Sun Nov 15 09:23:26 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- Fix desktop file/metainfo/icon file names: upstream spells the app ID
  com.pocoguy.Muse (not com.pocuguy.Muse); the mis-spelled paths made
  the %install step fail with "No such file or directory"

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Sun Nov 15 08:53:40 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- Fix offline RPM build: pass CARGO_NET_OFFLINE and RUSTY_V8_ARCHIVE to
  the %{cargo_install} step too; without them the v8 crate build script
  re-ran on env change and tried to download the prebuilt V8 archive,
  which the OBS build host cannot reach

