- version 2026.10.31.1+git20261031223600.a50a75d-0
- Port from fedora-nexus; Mixtapes Rust rewrite (gtk4 / libadwaita / WebKitGTK 6.0)
- Build offline: vendored crates (vendor-crates), pinned prebuilt V8 static library
- Use %{_datadir}/metainfo instead of the Fedora-only %{_metainfodir} macro
